                        "review": "A brilliant descent into deep-space psychological horror.\nThe narrative depth of this game is absolutely outstanding. From the very beginning, the overwhelming atmosphere hooks you instantly, delivering a gripping exploration of a derelict spaceship that becomes increasingly twisted and disturbing as you delve deeper. The voice performances are top-tier, the lingering sense of dread is incredibly rewarding, and the dark, existential concepts are brilliantly executed without making the gameplay feel artificially punishing. A highly recommended experience for sci-fi horror fans.",
